-- DISABLED — superseded by job_refresh_fundamentals. Do not apply.
--
-- The original reason given here ("no-op, because job_refresh_tv_data
-- overwrites sector every 5 min; the TV scanner is canonical") described a
-- real behaviour but drew the wrong conclusion: the TV job was overwriting the
-- BETTER value with a worse one. That is fixed — the TV job now only fills
-- sector when it is empty, and DPS owns the column.
--
-- This migration must still not be applied, for a different reason: its
-- hand-written mapping is a lossy guess at DPS's taxonomy, and it does not even
-- match DPS's real output.
--
--   verified against dps.psx.com.pk, 2026-07-15:
--     HBL   -> 'COMMERCIAL BANKS'                  (this file writes 'Commercial Banks')
--     LUCK  -> 'CEMENT'                            (this file writes 'Textile')
--     EFERT -> 'FERTILIZER'                        (this file writes 'Textile')
--     OGDC  -> 'OIL & GAS EXPLORATION COMPANIES'   (this file writes 'Oil & Gas')
--
-- Applying it would (a) collapse Cement, Fertilizer, Chemicals and Paper into
-- "Textile", because it inherits TradingView's coarse 18-bucket taxonomy, and
-- (b) introduce title-case duplicates of DPS's uppercase sectors, fragmenting
-- every sector into two heatmap tiles.
--
-- job_refresh_fundamentals scrapes the authoritative per-symbol sector straight
-- from the official PSX portal. That is the fix; this file is not.
--
-- Original content preserved below for reference.

-- Apply TV_SECTOR_MAP: remap TradingView sector taxonomy to DPS taxonomy.
-- This one-shot UPDATE replaces TV-style sectors (e.g. "Finance") with
-- their DPS equivalents (e.g. "Commercial Banks").
-- Spec: (internal workstream plan)

-- Source: backend/src/app/jobs/scheduler.py TV_SECTOR_MAP
UPDATE psx_profile SET sector = map.dps_sector
FROM (VALUES
    ('Finance', 'Commercial Banks'),
    ('Process Industries', 'Textile'),
    ('Consumer Non-Durables', 'Food & Personal Care Products'),
    ('Distribution Services', 'Distribution & Wholesale'),
    ('Technology Services', 'Technology & Communication'),
    ('Consumer Services', 'Cable & Other Services'),
    ('Producer Manufacturing', 'Engineering'),
    ('Industrial Services', 'Transport & Logistics'),
    ('Communications', 'Technology & Communication'),
    ('Electronic Technology', 'Technology & Communication'),
    ('Consumer Durables', 'Miscellaneous'),
    ('Non-Energy Minerals', 'Miscellaneous'),
    ('Energy Minerals', 'Oil & Gas'),
    ('Retail Trade', 'Miscellaneous'),
    ('Health Technology', 'Pharmaceuticals'),
    ('Utilities', 'Power Generation & Distribution'),
    ('Commercial Services', 'Miscellaneous'),
    ('Miscellaneous', 'Miscellaneous')
) AS map(tv_sector, dps_sector)
WHERE psx_profile.sector = map.tv_sector;

-- Also map the TradingView index categories
UPDATE psx_profile SET sector = map.dps_sector
FROM (VALUES
    ('Finance', 'Commercial Banks'),
    ('Process Industries', 'Textile'),
    ('Consumer Non-Durables', 'Food & Personal Care Products')
) AS map(tv_sector, dps_sector)
WHERE psx_profile.sector = map.tv_sector;
